# What Vercel does NOT need to build the till's web app.
#
# The repo also carries the Windows desktop shell and the database, and
# desktop/ alone is ~890MB of Electron modules and packaged installers. A
# CLI deploy would otherwise spend minutes uploading all of it to build a
# 1MB static site.

# The Electron desktop shell — built by the Windows CI workflow, not here.
desktop/

# Built by Vercel itself; uploading a local copy only risks it going stale.
dist/

# Database migrations and edge functions — deployed with the Supabase CLI.
supabase/
*.sql

# Image tooling and release scripts.
tools/

# Docs
*.md
!README.md
